‘All targets within reach’: Iran Army warns news US aggression will spread war beyond West Asia

Iran’s Army has asserted that American targets lying beyond West Asia are within the reach of the Islamic Republic’s Armed Forces, warning that any renewed US aggression would trigger a confrontation extending beyond the region.

